    "display_name": "Sleeping In",
    "bubble_choice_description": "Predict how many hours of sleep students will get.",
    "thumbnail_url": "https://images.code.org/bb9099a02a08b01168f5db8f4f538555-jaymantri-pillows-820149_1920.jpg",
    "encrypted": "false",
    "long_instructions": "Predict how many hours of sleep a student will get, given a certain number of hours of homework.\r\n\r\n**☑️ Do This:**\r\n\r\n- Complete the `loss` function. Prompt AI to help you if you need it.\r\n- Run your code.\r\n- Test your loss function on both the `predict_sleep_1` model and the `predict_sleep_2` model by changing which model is given to `visualize_model`. Compare the loss calculated for both models.",
